#                       224-byte Q6_K) the tiled variant reads the A operand by
#                       intel_sub_group_2d_block_read_16b_8r16x1c straight from global memory in
#                       the matrix unit's layout -- no tile staged, no barrier, no local memory,
#                       the work-group's subgroups sharing the block through L1 -- and the
#                       subgroup's sixteen weight rows by intel_sub_group_2d_block_read_transpose_
