#     2,730 / 6,382; Q6_K 14,824 / 33,813 -> 12,929 / 30,350. Its M = 1 decode figures unchanged.
#   The file-layout Q6_K (type 14, --gguf-q6k file; the staged path at 64 x 256 on the 24 GB
#     card): 9,888 us at M = 856 against the aligned layout's 4,399.
# Served on the 24 GB card (mixed form, u8 KV, +p10 base): prefill 672 -> 907 t/s at 856 tokens
# and 385 -> 451 at 71,727 (the operator's bars 1,341 and 460); the decode step unchanged (54.9 /
